# shadcn HTML components only

This repo is a **static HTML prototype**. Do not introduce React/Vite for UI. Build every screen and control with the shared shadcn-inspired kit.

## Required

- Use `assets/shadcn-ui.css` and classes like `ui-btn`, `ui-input`, `ui-select`, `ui-card`, `ui-label`, `ui-field`, `ui-alert`, `ui-badge`, `ui-chip`, `ui-check-row`, `ui-progress`, `ui-upload`, `ui-sidebar`, `ui-topbar`.
- For selects: use `<select class="ui-select">` plus `assets/ui-select.js` (enhances to a shadcn-style trigger + listbox). Do not leave bare native dropdown styling.
- For dates: use `<input class="ui-input" type="date">` plus `assets/ui-calendar.js` (enhances to a shadcn-style date picker + calendar popover). Do not leave bare native date pickers.
- For labels: use `<label class="ui-label">` plus `assets/ui-label.js`. Long names truncate with `...` on one line; hover shows the full name via `title`. Do not wrap field labels to a second line.
- For mobile nav (≤900px): put `.ui-sidebar-toggle` (hamburger) in `.ui-topbar`, use `.ui-sidebar-backdrop` + `.ui-sidebar-close`, and toggle `.sidebar-open` on `.ui-shell` to slide the sidebar in as a drawer. Do not leave the sidebar permanently hidden with no way to open it.
- Match patterns from [ui.shadcn.com](https://ui.shadcn.com/) (Button, Input, Card, Select, Alert, Checkbox, Progress, Badge, etc.) as plain HTML.
- Keep EnrollAxis teal tokens already defined in `shadcn-ui.css` (`--primary`, `--brand-*`).

## Minimal layer (agent onboarding)

`agent/onboarding.html` uses a Minimal-style layer on top of this kit (look inspired by minimals.cc, same brand tokens):

- `assets/minimal-ui.css` - `mx-*` components: nav shell, cards, soft labels, floating-label fields, option cards, switches, dropzone, toast, dialog, progress ring, timeline.
- `assets/minimal-ui.js` - `MX.toast`, `MX.dialog`, field validation via `data-rules` (+ `data-mask`), `MX.dropzone`, `MX.ring`.
- `assets/minimal-icons.js` - offline Solar duotone icon subset; use `<span data-icon="name"></span>` or `mxIcon('name')`. Add new icons to this bundle; do not load icons from a CDN.
- Errors: inline under the field, plus an error summary at the top of the step on Continue. Use toasts for system events, dialogs for confirmations. No `alert()` / `confirm()`.

## Do not

- Add Bootstrap, Material, or new one-off component CSS for screens.
- Scaffold React/Next/Vite apps for UI changes.
- Inline large ad-hoc form styles when a `ui-*` class already exists - extend `shadcn-ui.css` instead.
- Use AI-style em dashes (`—`) or en dashes (`–`) / `&mdash;` / `&ndash;`. Always use a plain hyphen (`-`). See skill `no-ai-em-dash`.

## Example

```html
<div class="ui-field">
  <label class="ui-label" for="email">Email</label>
  <input class="ui-input" id="email" type="email">
</div>
<button type="button" class="ui-btn">Continue</button>
<button type="button" class="ui-btn ui-btn-outline">Cancel</button>
```
